> References

- Paul-Virak Khuong and Pat Morin (2017 revision), *Array Layouts for
  Comparison-Based Searching*, arXiv:1509.05053, section 3.2.
  [Primary paper and revision history](https://arxiv.org/abs/1509.05053),
  [full paper](https://arxiv.org/pdf/1509.05053).
  The native API uses the complete-tree BFS layout with branchy exact membership;
  the paper's query interface and tuned implementations differ as explained above.
